{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）早上10時06分，警方接報，青衣清心街大王下村對開發生交通意外。據報有的士與私家車相撞，其中的士女司機被困車內昏迷不醒；救援人員到場將其救出，其後她逐漸轉醒，送院治理。駕駛私家車的司機，是演員崔錦棠，意外中他手受傷，一併送院。</p><p>現場消息稱，在《愛回家.開心速遞》中飾演Andy一角的崔錦棠駕駛比亞迪（BYD）沿楓樹窩路行駛，至清心街交界攔腰撞的士右邊車身。他在場向記者憶述，的士由清心街右轉出楓樹窩路：「佢（的士）偷個路口（向右轉），冇expect（預期）可以咁樣，好短，兩秒都唔肯定。」</p><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠手部受傷，在場接受檢查後送院。（ 黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166341007013318656294367.jpeg/r5u-abh9Dr6y9bx0iCfKxqqQTYlu6_WLqrMNN5OzDTc\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠手部受傷，在場接受檢查後送院。（ 黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"比亞迪（BYD）車頭損毀。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166342847209672704084561.jpeg/vVtcCsF_Az4DMONsiooUIm2-rNjIiJw_P4HhWwaB4Vs\"/><figcaption>比亞迪（BYD）車頭損毀。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士右邊車身損毀氣袋彈出。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166347583069622272547219.jpeg/voqMHwXw3ehU8Gg54OXnec1KqbE5R-zGuaoq84CqKvM\"/><figcaption>的士右邊車身損毀氣袋彈出。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士女司機送院治理。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166355417429708800305768.jpeg/_Q6ChqRHV7U7nF62oKTTmgZjHOWDXE2KrvJw6pfycOo\"/><figcaption>的士女司機送院治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠在場接受檢查後送院。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348116769640448420138.jpeg/chkV94_jdOSBROZrYaaQkykVDNFUZTddUznwfmo58H4\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠在場接受檢查後送院。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠在場接受檢查後送院。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348119894528000468750.jpeg/nzcb-bOmW3AAZTpKGQjxSh5Fv9R5VXhsILT-jRm0_o0\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠在場接受檢查後送院。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"崔錦棠的座駕車頭損毀。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348122453184512519784.jpeg/fDeD39qnXZmRic4cg7i6MPjRqGtc4PG2CNohHzHaIR8\"/><figcaption>崔錦棠的座駕車頭損毀。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BYD在楓樹窩路與由清心街駛出之的士相撞。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166354993003892736092341.jpeg/G_tbBr_P-19zZMZ6QAcQIW_2Ly3WCXAkZ_nHEl75xxI\"/><figcaption>BYD在楓樹窩路與由清心街駛出之的士相撞。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士右邊車身損毀。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348124961509376306159.jpeg/FtkUqnWkgWfvJEeUvKZIsYNGZq1oVvnTaO1vJ1Htbyc\"/><figcaption>的士右邊車身損毀。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士右邊車身損毀。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166348127583080448271348.jpeg/wsF5DBftvMjYV2maad9BB3E7pfDskyv1eLaIoEG2iKA\"/><figcaption>的士右邊車身損毀。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T04:24:19.392883+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":446,"images":10,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}